separated from the background!\n\nWe would appreciate it if you could provide us with transparent data with the background of the person separated.\n\nWe are on Twitter\nhttps://mobile.twitter.com/kocyokami_sub\n@kocyokami_sub", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@ma_mu_CHAN_/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2291311, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f1099bf6/uploads/origins/056c2d07-0c2d-4d3f-a4cf-ad61209dc6f0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9da3bb4a7ddda52ff179938de35e8023", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f1099bf6/uploads/origins/056c2d07-0c2d-4d3f-a4cf-ad61209dc6f0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9da3bb4a7ddda52ff179938de35e8023, https://si.imgix.net/f1099bf6/uploads/origins/056c2d07-0c2d-4d3f-a4cf-ad61209dc6f0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=38d320898e4d91169b40f56c2b0c05a2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f1099bf6/uploads/origins/056c2d07-0c2d-4d3f-a4cf-ad61209dc6f0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=31fbbdb7baebce702771a7e57e0193e1 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f1099bf6/uploads/origins/056c2d07-0c2d-4d3f-a4cf-ad61209dc6f0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cff00286927b5cf7da9e988c24238ebb", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f1099bf6/uploads/origins/056c2d07-0c2d-4d3f-a4cf-ad61209dc6f0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cff00286927b5cf7da9e988c24238ebb, https://si.imgix.net/f1099bf6/uploads/origins/056c2d07-0c2d-4d3f-a4cf-ad61209dc6f0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a4d8a93100fb875be80267237c9f64fd 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f1099bf6/uploads/origins/056c2d07-0c2d-4d3f-a4cf-ad61209dc6f0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=22fab85dbb68396143a94c4c770eec9b 3x"}, "body": "It is nice to meet you.\nI would like to ask you to draw an original character for me because your illustrations are wonderful,\nI would like to draw an original character for you. I designed the character by myself, so it may be a little messy!\n\nThis is a fluffy doggy gravedigger!\nHe is wearing a beret 🐶.\nPose and other details are up to you!\n\n↓Reference image\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1lecU9lRpCjgag_VFQRWYLQQKacmsN8hC/view?usp=drivesdk\n\n\n-Specifications Usage\nThumbnails, videos, SNS, etc.\nCredit will be given.\n\nWe would appreciate it if you could separate the layers, or if you could make the character transparent.\nThank you in advance for your cooperation.", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@ma_mu_CHAN_/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2291311, "client_id": 1893875, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f5c33fd5/uploads/origins/bb85ca9f-1875-4aa5-b136-427efba5e206?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d1cfb8f4b23ec8de9b47c4d394550fb7", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f5c33fd5/uploads/origins/bb85ca9f-1875-4aa5-b136-427efba5e206?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d1cfb8f4b23ec8de9b47c4d394550fb7, https://si.imgix.net/f5c33fd5/uploads/origins/bb85ca9f-1875-4aa5-b136-427efba5e206?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eb699af86ada029a0567ddc82f86954c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f5c33fd5/uploads/origins/bb85ca9f-1875-4aa5-b136-427efba5e206?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9e6480260b3728d89a892e0eeb4275b1 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f5c33fd5/uploads/origins/bb85ca9f-1875-4aa5-b136-427efba5e206?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5050f1041cfc46ab09953ccf578c566c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f5c33fd5/uploads/origins/bb85ca9f-1875-4aa5-b136-427efba5e206?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5050f1041cfc46ab09953ccf578c566c, https://si.imgix.net/f5c33fd5/uploads/origins/bb85ca9f-1875-4aa5-b136-427efba5e206?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5c24a59160842e2583c5d546f40f2d65 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f5c33fd5/uploads/origins/bb85ca9f-1875-4aa5-b136-427efba5e206?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7f3299e0cdbedcb820a7d50eb49ff4b2 3x"}, "body": "Thank you mamu for opening the Skeeb! 😭🫶 I am very happy! I love the illustrations I've commissioned before, and I've been using them for my lock screen ♡.\n\nI would love to commission it and send you a request!\n\nIntended use\nPersonal viewing, SNS icon or header\n\nThe image of her face and headdress are as shown in the picture.\nHer skin is white, bangs are long enough not to reach her eyes, hair length is around her chest, and her eyes are bright!\nHair color is light blue, inner color is pastel pink.\nHer eyes are a gradation of gray to light blue from the top!\nShe is wearing a headdress with a cloud/snowflake pin clip. ☁️❄️\n\nHer hair should be in a voluminous braid like in the second picture!\nPlease dress in jersey and apron: 🙇‍♀️\nThe jersey is a light blue like pastel color and the apron is white with a lot of frills! I'm not sure what I'm supposed to wear, but I'm sure I'll be fine.\nThe shoes are white with thick soles and loose socks. The clothes are not as shown in the picture, but can be arranged in many ways!\n\nAs for her personality, she is a crybaby, quiet, and loves cute things. She has a cute smile🍀.\n\nI would be happy if you could draw her as you like, as I like all of your coloring and composition!\nThank you for your consideration!\n\nhttps://twitter.com/_fu_uu/status/1675812504159780866?s=46&t=r6wuHHn_odmNC8MNaucR7w", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@ma_mu_CHAN_/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2291311, "client_id": 476749, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9b0e5e45/uploads/origins/52efecc2-89b4-4182-8425-14e4fed04698?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d26cb375bd73a056c7ac1c27429c8c27", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9b0e5e45/uploads/origins/52efecc2-89b4-4182-8425-14e4fed04698?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d26cb375bd73a056c7ac1c27429c8c27, https://si.imgix.net/9b0e5e45/uploads/origins/52efecc2-89b4-4182-8425-14e4fed04698?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=df34492432fd269013f0eadb8af3d858 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9b0e5e45/uploads/origins/52efecc2-89b4-4182-8425-14e4fed04698?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9fda99e540d2b13071e65df2e970c0f8 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9b0e5e45/uploads/origins/52efecc2-89b4-4182-8425-14e4fed04698?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=99785a36ddb7e1e169b49ba340bb7992", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9b0e5e45/uploads/origins/52efecc2-89b4-4182-8425-14e4fed04698?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=99785a36ddb7e1e169b49ba340bb7992, https://si.imgix.net/9b0e5e45/uploads/origins/52efecc2-89b4-4182-8425-14e4fed04698?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9b18c6488c2979157f4280403d6387ad 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9b0e5e45/uploads/origins/52efecc2-89b4-4182-8425-14e4fed04698?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7da006cd35a555dba2ae21b6f4958dbf 3x"}, "body": "Hello, mamu-sensei.\nI always look at your illustrations from the shadows.\nI would like to send you a request to draw a creative character if you would like.\n\nPlease send me your request at https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1kdxlgEnVyauFDMAmOslx8BZt13uDR1TJ\n\nThis is a poor reference material, but here is a picture for your reference.\nHe is a former angel, a devil boy with a jellyfish motif. He looks about 16 years old and has the appearance of a boy.\nHis gestures are adorable, he has a sheltered atmosphere, and his appearance is fragile and transparent. His tongue and blood are blue.\nI would be very happy if you could draw him freely.\nIf you don't understand any details, you are free to rearrange them.\nI would like to use your illustration as an icon, wallpaper, etc...!\n\nI would be very happy if you could draw a very cute illustration of a boy.\nI look forward to the opportunity to work with you.", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@ma_mu_CHAN_/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2291311, "client_id": 2347109, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1ac19972/uploads/origins/46ca99c0-21e5-43a8-8251-c609adb896cb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8349ef6abda849b8373e901e045d0019", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1ac19972/uploads/origins/46ca99c0-21e5-43a8-8251-c609adb896cb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8349ef6abda849b8373e901e045d0019, https://si.im